            <p>
                Artsiom Dusau is the founder and editor of USA Symbol. He built and maintains the site's state-symbol database, editorial templates, source checks, and page updates.
            </p>
            <p>
                He is a software engineer based in Chicago, Illinois. His work on USA Symbol focuses on making official U.S. state symbols, state facts, and rankings easier to verify, compare, and understand.
