                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Editorial review</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Pages are reviewed by Artsiom before publication. When official information changes, pages are updated. Corrections from readers are taken seriously.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 shadow-sm p-6 flex gap-4 items-start">
                <div class="w-9 h-9 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-code text-sm"></i>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Site engineering</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                        Artsiom built and runs the full technical stack — C#, ASP.NET Core, the content pipeline, and the frontend. Editorial and technical decisions are made by the same person, which keeps quality consistent end to end.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
